// EASCape: the fairy ring codes that lead somewhere in our game. Names from Void
// (fairy_ring_codes.toml, 2011, its spelling); each destination is the 2007 map's ring for that
// code (Void and the OSRS wiki agree). Left out, as our map has no ring there: AJQ (the cave
// south of Dorgesh-Kaan) and DLS (the Myreque hideout: In Search of the Myreque isn't in our
// game); ALP, BIR, BLQ, CLR and DIP came after August 2007.

